.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-dns-acme-challenge-status - Is the challenge record live?


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro dns acme-challenge status [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Is the challenge record live?

.PP
Asks both authoritative name servers (ns1/ns2.gyrodns.net) directly. \fBready\fR is true when both publish \fBvalue\fR\&. Poll every few seconds after adding (usually < 1 minute).

.PP
API: GET /cloud/dns/acme-challenge (operationId acmeChallengeStatus, scope dns_acme)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for status

.PP
\fB--name\fP=""
	_acme-challenge.

.PP
\fB--value\fP=""
	Challenge value (key authorization digest)


